    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "Any SSRI39\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        121.43795013427734,
        88.03441619873047,
        130.14544677734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "463ceb238ddaab97f3de7aadc4d80df4c3c7f0efa7cc070b39b42a79e50c9b9b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "(Up to maximum licensed dose\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        131.44288635253906,
        153.5974884033203,
        140.150390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5f373b1b7702eec90b3473e6f683d94c7da7ee88306cf73bc704f79386c5a23c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "If the first SSRI is not tolerated or has a poor response an \nalternative SSRI may be tried29\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.36000061035156,
        121.44539642333984,
        381.0126037597656,
        140.150390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9ab0278cef75b40b5cb9d761fa951367c6e6c6e5b9a1bfe507df434142e4d088"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Clomipramine\n(Up to 250mg)\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        146.46791076660156,
        102.35748291015625,
        165.17291259765625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "b11c1a9049eca537a000fea68988a0278230a6e2e1f327450e8cf15ecb646cb1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "Owing to poorer tolerability, recommended trying at least one SSRI \nfirst29\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.36000061035156,
        146.46791076660156,
        412.6700744628906,
        165.17291259765625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6ce8aff0ab46632463f1389c1ffddfde98f537568b644cc272eebf8d9055b47c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "Second-line drug treatment (Unlicensed or weaker evidence base)\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        171.31288146972656,
        273.9049987792969,
        180.20037841796875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5f95b7bd894530ffdf1a64371daa57681887098ca5e775259c80f6fec0279eea"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Add antipsychotic to SSRI\n(Low to moderate doses of \nantipsychotics used in studies)100,101\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        186.51536560058594,
        166.9008026123047,
        215.21786499023438
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5de0ee1740491597c39fd0d4db42ce3fdabac07ad8a352ff67775abf239f6712"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "Most evidence supports the use of aripiprazole or risperidone.100 \nSome evidence for haloperidol101\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.36000061035156,
        186.5178985595703,
        404.27117919921875,
        205.222900390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "41d415b62efd09670c752e5e6069073b307e6b9ba205e1a7057601f060ffd175"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Citalopram\n40mg with clomipramine 150mg\nBased on small randomised open label study102 Recommended by \nNICE29\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25,
        221.5428924560547,
        408.037109375,
        240.24789428710938
      ],
      "text_sha256": "48c27471770f16c5dc542665f816ca814cbe80484b57c2e9dae49dbe656f0c0a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "ECG monitoring required\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.360107421875,
        241.5428924560547,
        277.5201416015625,
        250.25039672851562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4f1110bdc32510ea9c71034854d9d07ad6dc8dd807b581956e83a9c582e893f3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Acetylcysteine103\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25010681152344,
        256.5653991699219,
        107.52742004394531,
        265.27288818359375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "3f56afc9e8ed3957efa99293310d2eeabb96690e2c572517adff3e12618ae727"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "up to 2400mg/day added to SRRI or \nclomipramine\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        266.5679016113281,
        172.3850860595703,
        285.27288818359375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4f7266b0258b3992009db80a93e0c492bca0cb8a339014c1bfa8facc1424d9a5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Gastrointestinal adverse effects may be problematic. Two of five \ncontrolled studies negative. Pooled effect shows benefit104\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.360107421875,
        256.5628967285156,
        403.2875061035156,
        275.26788330078125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "62fd1bcc0d81e46d21ac01b36a0a62a3f7fbd656d41179553edd7ea2b045f5ea"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Lamotrigine\n100mg + added to SSRI105\nLamotrigine dose must be titrated gradually as indicated in the SPC\nMay worsen OCD in some106\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        291.5928955078125,
        411.9652099609375,
        310.2978820800781
      ],
      "text_sha256": "86d72e7088f11ccc036831f98f3777a46d9b1a2fd6dfc3d744b2457ca138f8e7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Topiramate\nup to 400mg added to SSRI107,108\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        316.6178894042969,
        159.4243927001953,
        335.3228759765625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5d4a8a1a6a30a2661aa6527771bd48af5d21987c95ffbe75b147deeb4e5bfd6c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "Topiramate is not well tolerated, suggested benefits for compulsion \nbut not obsessions.107 Two trials found topiramate ineffective109,110\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.360107421875,
        316.6178894042969,
        414.477783203125,
        335.32537841796875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fc030bf91282c0d2dbe40c72acfa3a29d9f314bcbed2922b9af5cad1217c8d52"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "Experimental\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        341.462890625,
        101.9375991821289,
        350.35040283203125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "702e2f7671070157a0c2a6eb9d738ac3bfa6e376d61bff37dcfbbc7ca052d904"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "High dose SSRI:\nEscitalopram\n25–50mg111\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        356.4853820800781,
        109.84257507324219,
        385.3678894042969
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d6b3ad73b1e66b9b86bfb4ef0ffacd64cc1792b4a70501ae22671467b16427d0"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Sertraline\n250–400mg112\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.250099182128906,
        386.66790771484375,
        101.73081970214844,
        405.3728942871094
      ],
      "text_sha256": "40720dee33cd61be38abfa1a3fd7b9d8e9c4582dd61595b522e57ea690415021"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "Dose titrated gradually according to tolerability. ECG monitoring \nrecommended\n",
      "bbox": [
        197.360107421875,
        356.66790771484375,
        404.4652099609375,
        375.3728942871094
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f7b6a88e7b32697dda1bea7c7ae6d15fbc3148c7a3b2c00ffc6cd0ae6c9dac8d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0450-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Memantine\nGood evidence for 20mg/day added to SSRIs113\n",
      "bbox": [
        55.25010681152344,
